# __NAME__

A small Rastrillo app: one page, no database, no sign-in.

    go run ./cmd/__NAME__ -addr 127.0.0.1:8080
    go test ./...

Add a page: a route in internal/__PKG__/app.go, a template in
internal/__PKG__/templates/. When the app needs to store data, start
again with `rastrillo new --scaffold single` and move your pages across.
